    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You can draw and fire in one smooth action.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Quick_Draw\" title=\"Quick Draw\">Quick Draw</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> Once per encounter, you can draw a holstered weapon and attack as a single <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Standard_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Standard Action\">Standard Action</a>.</p><p><b>Normal:</b> With the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Quick_Draw\" title=\"Quick Draw\">Quick Draw</a> feat, drawing or holstering a weapon is a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a>.</p>",
